  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bretton Woods Project CORE support 2017-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bretton Woods Project will monitor the work of the IMF and the World Bank from the perspective of citizen participation, women&apos;s rights and gender equality, environmental impact and climate change in particular, responding to needs of national and regional civil society partners in terms of the accountability of mainly these two institutions. The key objective is to provide a platform for disseminating and analysing the work and governance of these institutions, and additionally to provide avenues and advice for influencing their work. the two particular areas of impact are identified as gender equality and environment / climate change affecting poor and marginalised people.</narrative>
  </description>
